# Commit and deploy

When you finish implementing requested changes in this project:

1. Commit with a clear message (do not commit secrets or `.env` files).
2. Push to `origin` on `main` (`https://github.com/sai9ram/sri-captures.git`).
3. Deploy with `npx vercel deploy --prod --yes` from the project root.

Tell the user the commit hash and production URL: **https://sri-captures-delta.vercel.app**.

Only skip commit/deploy when the user explicitly says not to, or when there are no file changes.
